  "files": [
    {
      "path": "index.html",
      "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>Pixel Temperature Converter</title>\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"style.css\">\n</head>\n<body>\n  <main class=\"card\">\n    <h1>Temperature Converter</h1>\n    <div class=\"field\">\n      <label for=\"temperature\">Temperature</label>\n      <input type=\"text\" id=\"temperature\" inputmode=\"decimal\" placeholder=\"e.g. 25\" autocomplete=\"off\">\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"field\">\n      <label for=\"direction\">Direction</label>\n      <select id=\"direction\">\n        <option value=\"c-to-f\">Celsius → Fahrenheit</option>\n        <option value=\"f-to-c\">Fahrenheit → Celsius</option>\n      </select>\n    </div>\n    <button id=\"convert\">Convert</button>\n    <p class=\"result-label\">Result</p>\n    <output id=\"result\" for=\"temperature direction\">--</output>\n    <p class=\"formula\">C→F: x×9/5+32 &nbsp;|&nbsp; F→C: (x−32)×5/9</p>\n  </main>\n  <script src=\"script.js\"></script>\n</body>\n</html>",
      "description": "Main HTML page with labeled input, select, button, and output."
    },
    {
      "path": "style.css",
      "content": ":root {\n  --bg: #1a1a2e;\n  --card: #16213e;\n  --accent: #e94560;\n  --text: #eaeaea;\n  --muted: #a0a0b0;\n  --border: #0f3460;\n}\n* { box-sizing: border-box; }\nbody {\n  margin: 0;\n  min-height: 100vh;\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: center;\n  background: var(--bg);\n  font-family: 'Courier New', Courier, monospace;\n  font-size: 16px;\n  color: var(--text);\n  padding: 16px;\n}\n.card {\n  background: var(--card);\n  border: 4px solid var(--border);\n  border-radius: 0;\n  padding: 24px;\n  width: 100%;\n  max-width: 400px;\n  box-shadow: 8px 8px 0 rgba(0,0,0,0.3);\n}\nh1 {\n  margin: 0 0 20px;\n  font-size: 1.4rem;\n  text-align: center;\n  color: var(--accent);\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  letter-spacing: 1px;\n}\n.field {\n  margin-bottom: 16px;\n}\nlabel {\n  display: block;\n  margin-bottom: 6px;\n  font-size: 0.9rem;\n  color: var(--muted);\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n}\ninput, select, button {\n  width: 100%;\n  padding: 12px;\n  font-family: inherit;\n  font-size: 1rem;\n  background: var(--bg);\n  color: var(--text);\n  border: 2px solid var(--border);\n  border-radius: 0;\n  outline: none;\n}\ninput:focus, select:focus, button:focus {\n  border-color: var(--accent);\n  box-shadow: 0 0 0 2px var(--accent);\n}\nbutton {\n  background: var(--accent);\n  color: #fff;\n  font-weight: bold;\n  cursor: pointer;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  margin-top: 4px;\n  transition: background 0.1s, transform 0.1s;\n}\nbutton:hover { background: #ff6b81; }\nbutton:active { transform: translate(2px, 2px); }\n.result-label {\n  margin: 20px 0 4px;\n  font-size: 0.9rem;\n  color: var(--muted);\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n}\noutput {\n  display: block;\n  font-size: 2rem;\n  font-weight: bold;\n  text-align: center;\n  padding: 12px;\n  background: var(--bg);\n  border: 2px solid var(--border);\n  min-height: 60px;\n  color: var(--accent);\n}\n.formula {\n  margin: 16px 0 0;\n  font-size: 0.8rem;\n  color: var(--muted);\n  text-align: center;\n}\n@media (max-width: 400px) {\n  .card { padding: 16px; }\n  h1 { font-size: 1.1rem; }\n  input, select, button { padding: 10px; }\n  output { font-size: 1.5rem; }\n}\n",
      "description": "Pixel-style CSS with responsive layout and control states."
    },
    {
      "path": "script.js",
      "content": "const temperatureInput = document.getElementById('temperature');\nconst directionSelect = document.getElementById('direction');\nconst convertButton = document.getElementById('convert');\nconst resultOutput = document.getElementById('result');\n\nfunction convert() {\n  const raw = temperatureInput.value.trim();\n  const value = Number(raw);\n  if (raw === '' || !Number.isFinite(value)) {\n    resultOutput.textContent = 'Error';\n    return;\n  }\n  const direction = directionSelect.value;\n  let result;\n  if (direction === 'c-to-f') {\n    result = value * 9 / 5 + 32;\n  } else {\n    result = (value - 32) * 5 / 9;\n  }\n  if (!Number.isFinite(result)) {\n    resultOutput.textContent = 'Error';\n  } else {\n    resultOutput.textContent = result.toFixed(2);\n  }\n}\n\nconvertButton.addEventListener('click', convert);\ntemperatureInput.addEventListener('keydown', (e) => {\n  if (e.key === 'Enter') convert();\n});\n",
      "description": "Conversion logic with validation, error handling, and Enter key support."
    },
    {
      "path": "README.md",
      "content": "# Pixel Temperature Converter\n\nA retro pixel-style temperature converter that runs entirely offline in your browser.\n\n## Usage\n\n1. Open `index.html` in any modern browser.\n2. Enter a temperature in the text field.\n3. Select the conversion direction.\n4. Click **Convert** (or press Enter).\n5. The result appears with exactly two decimal places, without units.\n\n## Formulas\n\n- **Celsius to Fahrenheit:** `x × 9/5 + 32`\n- **Fahrenheit to Celsius:** `(x − 32) × 5/9`\n\n## Error Handling\n\nEmpty input, non-numeric input, or non-finite results display `Error`.\n\n## Technical Notes\n\n- Pure HTML, CSS, and JavaScript — no dependencies, packages, or network requests.\n- No storage or external assets.\n- Keyboard accessible with labeled controls and visible focus states.\n- Responsive design down to 360px width.\n",
      "description": "Documentation with usage, formulas, and technical notes."
    }
  ]
}